---
import Book from '../../layouts/Book.astro';import{lessons,label,moduleNames,readingMinutes,formatMinutes}from'../../lib/content';
const main=lessons.filter(l=>l.path==='main');
const minutes=new Map(await Promise.all(main.map(async l=>[l.id,await readingMinutes(l)] as const)));
const modules=[...new Set(main.map(l=>l.module))].map(m=>({module:m,id:`module-${m}`,title:moduleNames[m],lessons:main.filter(l=>l.module===m)}));
const sections=modules.map(m=>({id:m.id,title:`${String(m.module).padStart(2,'0')} · ${m.title}`}));
const first=main.slice(0,2);
---
<Book title="Complete algorithms path" sections={sections} tocLabel="ON THIS PAGE"><span class="eyebrow">ONE COHERENT TRAVERSAL OF EVERY ALGORITHM FAMILY</span><h1>Complete algorithms path</h1><p class="dek">Start with Deutsch and Grover. Expand a missing prerequisite when the current calculation needs it.</p><p class="small muted">Renamed on 2 November 2026: this was the "Recommended main path". The default route is now the <a href="/path/">decision path</a>. {main.length} lessons, about {formatMinutes(main.reduce((t,l)=>t+minutes.get(l.id)!,0))} by the <a href="/path/#time-estimates">time model</a>.</p><div class="context-box"><p><strong>First sitting:</strong> {first.map((l,i)=><Fragment>{i>0?' then ':''}<a href={`/lessons/${l.id}/`}>{label(l)}</a></Fragment>)}, about {first.reduce((t,l)=>t+minutes.get(l.id)!,0)} minutes together. Each lesson page's Next button follows this path and offers optional branches without forcing them.</p><p>A branch is optional for the main narrative, not a judgment of its importance. Follow a chapter's explicit prerequisite links when you reach it.</p><p>Keep a one-sentence checkpoint: “We are trying to learn ___, this operation changes ___, and the next measurement reveals ___.”</p></div>{modules.map(m=><section><h2 id={m.id} class="path-module">{String(m.module).padStart(2,'0')} · {m.title}</h2><ol class="catalog-list">{m.lessons.map(l=><li><a href={`/lessons/${l.id}/`}>{label(l)}</a><p>{l.summary}</p><p class="path-minutes">About {minutes.get(l.id)} min</p>{l.editorial==='partial'&&<span class="badge partial">Partial · see specific gaps</span>}</li>)}</ol></section>)}<p><a href="/index/">Browse every branch and family →</a></p></Book>
